cb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b6HDjQv3Yu8Q7kNvwHwVNqL&_nc_oc=AdpOj_YPGN0Wxp59euBJEFDeazjycJ4a1iUYjodMFZF99oW3jRU-E2aVm-H8EkUpgd4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTBAUBfnI9lUeHY6D-QGEZ9bVIgbwS-BY5k3A3WJaqZoA&oe=6AFF14AA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SBS-1.png", "id": "1889401618406419", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_1889401621739752_8904061124924124698_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kY7JesRAQXQQ7kNvwHH9lJs&_nc_oc=AdqTd2Jl_AvhO0cdjlHyOTjbURtDLS8LSEPIB3NXa5LytupU1JyfUip5UopWL7KnCns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSjjd-7jBYOaGQlXqQteaqUesPFY96SyaNz6GO6GShH5Q&oe=6AFF0FBD"}, "display_name": "Subspace Battle Simulator", "keywords": ["battlesimulator", "bs", "simulator", "subspace"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate battlefield with Subspace Battle Simulator: VR Edition! Immerse yourself in chaotic, cartoon-style warfare as you command epic armies across stunning virtual battlefields. Take direct control of legendary warriors, fearsome dragons, and powerful mages, or orchestrate large-scale battles from a god's-eye view. With intuitive VR controls, you'll dodge arrows, cast devastating spells, and lead your troops to victory in real-time. Experience hilarious ragdoll physics, dynamic environmental destruction, and endless strategic possibilities. Whether you're a casual gamer looking for laughs or a strategy enthusiast craving tactical depth, this VR adaptation delivers an unmatched combat experience. ", "short_description": "The game offers a top-down perspective and a first-person VR experience. It is played based on a sandbox simulation and PVE (Player vs. Environment) challenges. The game provides over a dozen different types of combat units, and players can freely combine and configure them to build their own most powerful army to defeat the enemies."}]}, "developer_nam